# safe_browsing_prefs.h (CL 6898756) after ungoogled's
# remove-unused-preferences-fields.patch was last regenerated, so the constant
# survives there. move-js-optimizer-unfamiliar-sites.patch then defines the same
# constant in content_settings/core/common/pref_names.h, causing a redefinition
# error when both headers are transitively included. Drop the safebrowsing copy.

